{"content":[{"c":["EVI"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["One of five Midianite kings killed in a battle against Israel under the leadership of Moses (",{"href":"?bref=Num.31.8","r":"Num.31.8","rawR":"Num.31.8","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Num.31.8","value":"Num.31.8"}],"t":"ref","v":"Nm 31:8"},"). Apparently, God directed Moses to go to battle against Midian because the Midianites had led the Israelites into pagan religious practices. In ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.13.21","r":"Josh.13.21","rawR":"Josh.13.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.13.21","value":"Josh.13.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Joshua 13:21"},", Evi is called a prince of Sihon, the Midianite king."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Evi","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Nm 31:8","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Num.31.8","rawQueryValue":"Num.31.8","sourceRefExact":"Num.31.8"},{"anchorText":"Joshua 13:21","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.13.21","rawQueryValue":"Josh.13.21","sourceRefExact":"Josh.13.21"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"8337d464f0024f0c8b8bff7ca3ff94d883ad06e52a18f64699e32193b6fe96a1","sourceItemName":"Evi","sourceItemOrder":285,"sourceMember":"Articles/E.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Evi","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Evi","title":"Evi","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}